{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07882","headline":"同张明府碧溪赠答 · 孟浩然","name":"同张明府碧溪赠答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别业闻新制，同声和者多。\n还看碧溪答，不羡绿珠歌。\n自有阳台女，朝朝拾翠过。\n绮筵铺锦绣，妆牖闭藤萝。\n秩满休闲日，春余景气和。\n仙凫能作伴，罗袜共凌波。\n曲岛寻花药，回潭折芰荷。\n更怜斜日照，红粉艳青娥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}